      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The cadence is highly rhythmic, favoring smooth, unbroken connections between words, which creates a scalar, rising momentum. The structure often moves from an abstract concept (e.g., \"Empower\") to a desired state (e.g., \"your journey\"), mirroring persuasive increases in commitment. When sequenced, this flow can induce a Zeigarnik effect, leading the subconscious to anticipate resolution or stated benefit, making the listener more receptive to the final call to action.",
